{"unit_id":"MrElysium__convoport#card-zh","repo":"MrElysium/convoport","commit":"2d1db13d9f7753b354371a3183d4208bb1954445","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"convoport 是面向 DSH Web 的对话捕获与导入插件，配合 Chrome 浏览器扩展从 DeepSeek 网页会话读取消息，并通过本地接口保存为 JSON 记录。它在 DSH 中提供捕获统计命令、对话查询与搜索接口，以及 Convoport 对话区面板。用户可以查看捕获列表和 Token 统计、搜索历史消息、挑选单条消息并将所选内容导入当前工作区的新会话，也可以删除不再需要的捕获记录。数据保存在本机 DSH 目录，搜索可使用 SQLite FTS5 并在不可用时回退到 JSON 扫描；需要安装浏览器扩展并运行 DSH Web 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:474-566","lib/index.js:340-468","lib/client.js:132-185","extension/content.js:40-54"]}
{"unit_id":"MrElysium__convoport#card-en","repo":"MrElysium/convoport","commit":"2d1db13d9f7753b354371a3183d4208bb1954445","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"convoport captures DeepSeek web chats through a Chrome extension and stores them locally for DSH Web. Its command and conversation view show statistics, list and search saved messages, and let users select messages to import into a new workspace session or delete a capture.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:474-566","lib/index.js:340-468","lib/client.js:132-185","extension/content.js:40-54"]}
