{"unit_id":"MrElysium__convoport#feature-1","repo":"MrElysium/convoport","commit":"2d1db13d9f7753b354371a3183d4208bb1954445","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"convoport 的功能「对话自动捕获」：浏览器扩展在 DeepSeek 会话页面读取历史消息，并把捕获内容发给本机 DSH 接口保存。 可在 Web 面板或对应的捕获接口中使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["extension/content.js:40-54","extension/content.js:92-117","extension/background.js:60-82"]}
