{"unit_id":"MrElysium__convoport#feature-3","repo":"MrElysium/convoport","commit":"2d1db13d9f7753b354371a3183d4208bb1954445","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"convoport 的功能「捕获记录搜索与管理」：面板可查看记录、搜索消息、查看统计；服务端也提供列出、删除记录的接口。 可在 Web 面板或对应的捕获接口中使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:146-170","lib/index.js:146-183","lib/index.js:518-559"]}
{"unit_id":"MrElysium__convoport#caveat-1","repo":"MrElysium/convoport","commit":"2d1db13d9f7753b354371a3183d4208bb1954445","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"convoport 使用前须知：浏览器扩展会向 chat.deepseek.com 请求当前会话历史，并把解析出的消息内容发送到配置的本地 DSH 后端保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["extension/content.js:40-54","extension/background.js:67-75"]}
